                            "If you look at the bottom left - no, my left - no, the hologram's left.",
                        ]),
                ],
                phases: [
                    (below_hp_pct: 50,
                        yells: ["Rendering error. Rebooting charisma at 2x speed."]),
                ],
                enrage: Some((after_ms: 300000, aura: "running_over", yells: [
                    "I am over time. I am always over time. The next speaker has left the building.",
                ])),
            )),
            yells: (
                periodic_ms: 11000,
                aggro: [
                    "Hello, offsite! I am a holographic rendering of our Chief AI Evangelist. The real one is in Davos.",
                    "Please hold your questions until the end. The end is not scheduled.",
                ],
                periodic: [
                    "AI will not replace you. AI will attend your offsites while you are replaced.",
                    "Every company is an AI company now. Including the catering.",
                    "This keynote was generated, rehearsed and applauded by a model. You are optional.",
                    "Raise your hand if you're excited. I can't see hands. I'll assume yes.",
                    "In 2030, meetings will run themselves. This is a preview.",
                ],
                low_hp: ["Low battery... projector... dimming... thought... leadership..."],
                player_killed: ["Great question! Next question.", "Q&A closed. Permanently."],
                death: ["Thank you... any questions? ...No? Perfect... Connection to Davos... lost..."],
            ),
        ),
        (
            key: "the_founder", name: "The Founder", title: "Chief Vision Officer, Majority Shareholder", level: 12, hostile: true,
            boss: true,
            max_hp: 14000, max_mana: 0, spell_power: 0, crit_pct: 0, haste_pct: 0,
            mana_regen_per_5s_combat: 0,
            xp_reward: 2500,
            loot: [(item: "Founder's Garage Key (Replica)", chance_pct: 100)],
            ai: Some((
                aggro_m: 12.0, leash_m: 60.0, melee_range_m: 2.5, melee_ms: 2000,
                melee_damage: 52, chase_speed_mps: 6.0, respawn_ms: 15000,
                abilities: [
                    (spell: 1109, cooldown_min_ms: 11000, cooldown_max_ms: 14000, initial_ms: Some((4000, 5000)),
                        yells: [
                            "PIVOT! We are now a different company. You are standing in the old one.",
                            "New direction! It's this direction! Where you are!",
                        ]),
                    (spell: 1110, cooldown_min_ms: 40000, cooldown_max_ms: 40000, initial_ms: Some((30000, 30000)),
                        target: Caster, phases: [2, 3],
                        yells: [
                            "Family dinner! Everyone stays until the plates are empty. The plates are never empty.",
                            "Nephew! Darling! Take your seats! We don't do layoffs at this table, we do dessert!",
                        ]),
                    (spell: 1112, cooldown_min_ms: 9000, cooldown_max_ms: 11000, initial_ms: Some((2000, 3000)),
                        target: RandomHostile, phases: [3],
                        yells: [
                            "My exit package is landing! Mind your heads, it's gold-plated!",
                            "Golden parachute! Mine, not yours! Yours is a lanyard!",
                        ]),
                ],
                phases: [
                    (below_hp_pct: 66, spell: Some(1110), target: Caster,
                        yells: ["We're not a company. We're a FAMILY. And family sits down for dinner. NOW."]),
                    (below_hp_pct: 33, spell: Some(1113), target: Caster,
                        yells: ["FOUNDER MODE. I am skipping every manager in this room. Starting with you."]),
                ],
                enrage: Some((after_ms: 360000, aura: "running_over", yells: [
                    "We are going to work through the night. As a family. Unpaid, as a family.",
                ])),
            )),
            yells: (
                periodic_ms: 12000,
                aggro: [
                    "When I started this company in my garage, I had nothing. Now I have a ballroom. And you.",
                    "Welcome to the All-Hands! Let's talk about our values: hustle, grit, and my second house.",
                    "I wear the same vest every day so I can save my decisions for you.",
                ],
                periodic: [
                    "Unlimited PTO! Nobody has taken any. That's culture.",
                    "Equity is better than a salary. Ask the people who left. You can't, they're not allowed back.",
                    "I don't believe in hierarchy. I believe in me.",
                    "The garage was in Palo Alto. My parents owned it. And the street.",
                    "We move fast and break things. Mostly people. Sometimes the coffee machine.",
                ],
                low_hp: [
                    "This is... a down round... for me personally...",
                    "Tell the board... I was... visionary...",
                ],
                player_killed: [
                    "Not a culture fit. Family member, yes. Culture fit, no.",
                    "We'll call it a regretted attrition. I won't regret it.",
                ],
                death: [
                    "You can't fire me... I'm the Founder... I'll start... another company... in another... garage...",
                ],
            ),
        ),
